# fpm build/install artifacts
/_build_fpm/
/_install_fpm/

# meson build/install artifacts, and everything its wrap fetches fresh from
# GitHub every time -- s-dftd3 itself and, promoted up by Meson, its own
# subprojects (mctc-lib, toml-f, ...) and their .wrap files. Only the wrap
# file this directory authors itself, subprojects/s-dftd3.wrap, is tracked.
/_build_meson/
/_install_meson/
/subprojects/*
!/subprojects/s-dftd3.wrap
